OL,3,GNEWSAWork starts on solar farm to power
OL,4,A9,600 homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork has started on building a
OL,7,Fcouncil-owned solar farm that it is
OL,8,Fhoped will generate enough power for
OL,9,Fabout 9,400 homes.
OL,11,FWokingham Borough Council said Barkham
OL,12,FSolar Farm would provide income to
OL,13,Fsupport its services and could be
OL,14,Fconnected to the National Grid from
OL,15,FSeptember 2027.
OL,17,FThe first phase of enabling work will
OL,18,Finclude creating the site's entrance,
OL,19,Festablishing its construction compound,
OL,20,Fand carrying out other preparatory
OL,21,Fwork.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
